/E (Women facing harassment, stalking, or sudden threats may be unable to access their phones or activate SOS systems during emergencies. Existing safety solutions rely on smartphones, internet connectivity, and manual activation, creating critical gaps in emergency protection. Therefore, there is a need for a discreet, intelligent, and reliable hands-free safety system that can automatically detect threats, send instant alerts, share location, and preserve evidence without depending on internet connectivity.)
